==Battleground==
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*4 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*7 [[Croco]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Chocolate Cat (Enemy)|Chocolate Cat]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.
**3 [[Squire Rel]]s (100%) spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s (150%) spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage should be quite easy as all the enemies are very weak, including Chocolate Cat, who only has 30,000 HP and 825 attack power. The Metal Hippoe can be taken care of using Critical Hitters or just fast attacks from the likes of [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]].

